      "[2026-08-03-l10n-explain-channel] **Two verification scripts, `npm run verify:l10n`** (`scripts/verify-l10n-explain.mjs`, `scripts/verify-l10n-lazy.mjs`). Between them they cover file → map → card: the lazy script checks all 30 (track, source) tables resolve identical to a direct import, plus the null and memo contracts; the explain script checks the overlay reaches the card, the English fallback survives, regional `{ latam, spain }` values survive, and es/en are untouched.",
