      "[2026-07-28-e2e-credential-gate] **The authenticated E2E suite has been skipping silently in CI for months.** `E2E_TEST_EMAIL` / `E2E_TEST_PASSWORD` were never set, and both the spec and the workflow treated that as fine, so 6 of the suite's 20 tests never ran while the board stayed green. The v3.1.1 production bug (raw string keys rendered to every user in every language) shipped under exactly that green-looking board.",
