      "[2026-07-28-e2e-credential-gate] **`scripts/rollup-changelog.mjs` would have broken today's small-release convention.** It swept *all* of `unreleased/` and archived everything under `CURRENT_VERSION`, so cutting a Z mid-milestone would have published half-built Y work in the release notes and filed those fragments under the wrong version — with nothing left in `unreleased/` to show it happened. The convention shipped this morning as documentation only; the tooling contradicted it.",
