      "[2026-07-28-e2e-credential-gate] · **`.env.local` credentials never reached the tests.** Playwright runs as its own Node process and does not inherit Next.js's env loading, so the documented local setup could not have worked: the app under test saw the vars, the spec that needed them did not, and the authenticated tests skipped regardless of what was in the file. `playwright.config.js` now parses `.env.local` itself (~10 lines, no dotenv dependency); existing env vars win, so CI is unaffected.",
