      "[2026-07-28-e2e-credential-gate] · **Fix, `app/play/[trackId]/page.js`:** added `data-testid` to the five elements the suite drives — `answer-option`, `next-question`, `round-complete`, `start-round`, `view-explanations`. Attributes only; no visible surface, so no UI preview needed. `start-round` and `view-explanations` appear twice each (start screen and result screen) and resolve uniquely at runtime since only one screen mounts at a time.",
